      "message": "How exactly does this work?  I think you\u0027re passing in a copy, which DnsManager modifies and then we effectively discard it to pass in another copy to handleUpdateLinkProperties...\n\nI must be confused about something...\n\nI guess I just expected this to be passing in nai.linkProperties directly.",
