      "writtenOn": "2018-03-01T18:39:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "updateLinkProperties appears to only send a network callback if the old and new LPs actually differ by the end of the function. I\u0027m calling maybeFixLinkPropertiesPrivateDns with a copy to check if the private DNS fields need updating but am waiting to actually update them until updateLinkProperties in order to trigger a callback. For handleUpdateLinkProperties, I\u0027m passing in a copy so that the old and new LPs sent to updateLinkProperties aren\u0027t the same object. (There\u0027s an earlier comment on this file in patchset 9 about spurious LP updates that\u0027s related.)",
      "parentUuid": "26072fe1_4a215aef",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2315,
